            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nThis text uses all the content we learned before in the *First Steps* section (<htcite0>). So, we suggest you study it before continuing.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "b5efc8f9-c268-430f-9681-7a43848ee48e",
                     "text": "Hitory Tracers Team",
                     "page": "First Steps",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2024",
                        "month": "-1",
